WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.360
Let's create an online course in HAX

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.080
CMS.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.000
So, using the HAX CMS site dashboard,

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.120
I click online course,

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.240
and we're going to name this

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.720
HAX 100.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.840
I can either hit enter or click create

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.040
site.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:24.040
And in just a second, we have our hat

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.960
with the progress bar filled up. I can

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.120
either stay here and review the sites I

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.680
have or click to open the site in a new

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.000
tab.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.360
So, I'm going to click stay here.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.960
You can see that when we come back to

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:38.240
our dashboard, our tray will start to

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.240
fill up with all the different sites

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.160
that we're creating.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.120
We can also click on these dots to

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:50.280
either copy the space,

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.120
to download the space, which will give

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.240
it to us as a zip file,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.200
to create a template from the space,

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.560
which is a reusable version of this site

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.960
after we've made changes to it as far as

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:07.160
the settings, theme selection, and

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.760
content. So, I can either download this

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:12.280
or I could save it to my templates,

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:17.320
or I could archive it.

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:20.120
So, to access HAX 100, I just click on

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:24.040
the course site.

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:25.400
And now we're in it, it's time to start

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:27.400
editing.
